{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t天文台表示，一股強烈東北季候風及一道雲雨帶正影響廣東沿岸，預測今日天氣顯著轉涼，初時市區氣溫約15度，日間氣溫繼續下降至約13度，新界再低一兩度，新界部分地區及高地寒冷。<br/>\n<br/>\n天文台又說，明日漸轉天晴，但早上仍然相當清涼。隨後一兩日雲量增多，風勢頗大，氣溫稍為回升。<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：羅宇光\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T01:43:50.967712+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T01:27:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:37:30.875069+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T01:37:26.851461+00:00","content_hash":"e522724bbfaa9826025fd25f1ebfd5784367c6d71d5503d0736632caf6122d81","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}